## Assumptions and limitations

No count likelihood for RPM; no donor p-values/CI absent donor replication; sample ranges and sensitivity envelopes are not confidence intervals. Selected SOX10/H3K4me3-associated universe is not whole transcriptome. P2 is a measured specificity comparator, never an invariant normalization control. Absolute means mean RPM response, not calibrated molecules per cell. Composition uses selected start signals, not full-length transcript fractions. Mouse enhancer and rat signaling contexts are kept separate.

